  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon packed brown sugar",
    "1 tablespoon paprika",
    "1 tablespoon chili powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "4 pounds beef short ribs (bone-in), trimmed of fat",
    "Reynolds Wrap® Heavy Duty Aluminum Foil",
    "0.5 cup barbecue sauce, plus additional for serving"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Mix brown sugar, paprika, chili powder, salt, and garlic powder in a medium bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uENzT_VjjtNDKH8_h1Xe7gN8Tro=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238139-grilled-bbq-short-ribs-with-dry-rub-ddmfs-step1-0694-43f09e15fa65458d9f7131ad1facfd04.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238139/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut ribs into equal portions. Generously rub spice mixture onto all surfaces of ribs; place ribs in a single layer in a glass baking dish. Cover and refrigerator for 30 minutes to 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AgXQ4Mzbxy5CQdMe_QRxbyVQ040=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238139-grilled-bbq-short-ribs-with-dry-rub-ddmfs-step2-0695-bb2bfa73ea474d43bcc721c22d100988.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238139/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat grill to medium indirect heat, 375 to 400 degrees F (190 to 200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Center one portion ribs on a 12x18-inch sheet of heavy-duty aluminum foil; add 2 ice cubes. Bring up the foil sides, then double-fold the top and ends to seal the packet, leaving room for heat circulation inside. Repeat to make 3 more packets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mF9EV2B_fwYBBMUfc0oAvzjuPag=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238139-grilled-bbq-short-ribs-with-dry-rub-ddmfs-step3-0723-b851f858441448369444c54f19f2613c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238139/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange packets over indirect heat on the preheated grill. Cover and cook until tender, 1 1/2 to 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uduWtSK47RyXNGDwDzfNhWRfOAo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238139-grilled-bbq-short-ribs-with-dry-rub-ddmfs-step4-0726-7417f32713d04468acf86ab54f0601a7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238139/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Uncover the grill. Keeping the foil packets on the grill, open them carefully by cutting along the top folds with a sharp knife, allowing steam to escape; then proceed to open packets fully.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xWLqpPqOsOKm4PMKdeP8e3k3T6I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238139-grilled-bbq-short-ribs-with-dry-rub-ddmfs-step5-0766-b51e9c9adc1c471e8f91b1b6e14ea71e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238139/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush ribs with about 1/2 cup barbecue sauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mXwBT824MyfYWc9eC2GDFEQ3V7k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238139-grilled-bbq-short-ribs-with-dry-rub-ddmfs-step6-0768-f82f38f387554aaa84e6604f05ccf016.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238139/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Move packets over direct heat, cover, and continue grilling, turning once, until ribs are browned and crisp, about 5 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ABIKYtZ511gWhWgSaWqe-Iwq2Os=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238139-grilled-bbq-short-ribs-with-dry-rub-ddmfs-step7-0775-df93a48236674a279cc37be71ce3d4ea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238139/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with additional barbecue sauce as desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gUqmKn35ntOMPz9SEWSWdeW7rA8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238139-grilled-bbq-short-ribs-with-dry-rub-ddmfs-4x3-0804-e2fcbe29fb204fc3b409069d963f2b46.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238139/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
